00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,580
laid off after the closure.

285
00:13:40,340 --> 00:13:43,440
That is the quieter scale of the disaster.

286
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:47,640
The famous sequence the whirlpool, the collapsing

287
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:51,140
bank, the reversed canal lasted hours.

288
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:54,620
For the people whose livelihoods depended on the mine,

289
00:13:55,140 --> 00:13:58,740
