296
00:14:20,940 --> 00:14:23,960
One Oak says the facility connects with eight major

297
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:24,520
pipelines.

298
00:14:25,540 --> 00:14:28,140
That does not mean today's storage system is the

299
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:28,840
