308
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:53,680
Gardens.

309
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:55,760
A drilling platform.

310
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:59,860
The dangerous map was the one underneath it.

311
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:02,100
Mine levels cut through salt.

312
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:05,180
A drilling path descending from above.

313
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:09,820
Two industries occupying the same three-dimensional space.

314
00:15:10,740 --> 00:15:14,300
When those worlds became connected, gravity and salt

315
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:15,840
