329
00:15:49,660 --> 00:15:52,160
The decisive infrastructure was hidden.

330
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:56,380
Lake Peigneur is remembered because a lake disappeared.

331
00:15:57,420 --> 00:15:59,380
